OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-$-%%%-!-%%%" ,%-$ -$%%-% ,,
OL,3,GNEWSA'I'm an Olympic champion - but my
OL,4,Apassion is art'
OL,5,
OL,6,FHanging artwork inside a fine art
OL,7,Fgallery near Leicester Square is not
OL,8,Fwhere you would expect to find a
OL,9,Freigning Olympic champion.
OL,11,FEmily Craig, 33, won gold with Imogen
OL,12,FGrant in the lightweight double skull
OL,13,Fevent in Paris, dubbed the "last ever"
OL,14,Fchampions, with the discipline now
OL,15,Fremoved from the Olympic programme.
OL,17,FImogen continues to row, hoping to
OL,18,Freach LA in a higher weight class, but
OL,19,FEmily, who is from Pembury, now works
OL,20,Fin the art world.
OL,23,APub: 12-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
